The reference/ directory preserves the vLLM 0.9.2 source snapshot used by the
Jetson experiments. Original SPDX and contributor copyright notices are retained.
Exact source hashes are recorded in manifest.json and reference/environment.json.

payload/block_pool.py modifies the reference BlockPool to select a retention
queue, record actual reuse and reset retention history. See block_pool.patch.
payload/prefix_retention.py adds the experimental SLRU implementation.
